  "reference": "Deuteronoma 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu Yehova waŋilili nindi, Sesaku maloleyi awubasa ayedi adineyi ana akusambila, wukanduki kunu kumpidi kunidi, wutuŋichimbaŋu cheyi chamutondu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamalola awubasa nukusonekahu mazuadiŋi hamalola awubasa akusambila iwafumpili, wakayishi muchimbaŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi natuŋili chimbapu chamapalanga anyishitimi, naseseli malola awubasa ayedi neyi ana ásambilili, nakandukili hampidi, malola awu basa ayedi adi muchikasa chami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamalola awubasa wasonekeluhu neyimwasonekeliyi hakusambila, joji nshimbi ikumi jahosheliyi Yehova nanenu hampidi, izu dindi difumaŋa mukesi ifuku dakupompa; Yehova wayinyinkeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nabalumukili, nakunkumukili mpidi, nashili malola awubasa muchimbaŋu chinatupili; mwomwaduwu nihanu, mwomwanlejeliyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela afumini kuBeyeroti Beneyayakani ayili kuMosera; kwokwafwilililiyi Aroni, kwokwamuŋikililuwu; mwanindi Eleyazari wahipilumu hakukoŋa mudimu wawupristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afumini kwenoku ayili kuGudigoda; afumini kuGudigoda ayili kuYotibata, ituŋa datutuloŋa twameji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henahana dihu haambwililiyi Yehova muchidi waLevi kulonda asendaŋa chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu chaYehova, kulonda emanaŋa ni kumesu aYehova nakumukalakela, akiswilaŋa ninkisu mwijina dindi nikwitaŋwa dalelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hafuma Levi kubula iseka hela wuswana wakubombela nawanakwindi; Yehova diwu wuswana windi, mwomwahosheliyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi nayena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nashakamini hampidi, neyi hakusambila, mafuku makumi awananimwaana niwufuku, nihenohu nawa Yehova wantiyilili; Yehova walekeli kukujilumuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wapilili nindi, Nyamukaku wukwati njila yeyi yakuya kumbidi yawantu; niwena akeŋila nakuheta ituŋa dinasanyikilili ankakulula jawu kuyinkadu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu enu aIsarela Yehova Nzambi yenu nakeŋi chumanyi kudenu? Nakeŋi nindi chiŋa mumutiyaŋa Yehova Nzambi yenu woma, mwendimunjila jindi jejima, mumukeŋi, mumukalakeli Yehova Nzambi yenu nanyichima yenu yejima, nawumi wenu wejima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwovwahili mwanayilejiyi Yehova, nimuyidika yindi, munukuyileja lelu kulonda mumonikuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talaku, niiwulu, niiwulu damawulu, niiseki, hamu nayumayejima yekalamu, yaYehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi Yehova watiyili kuwahaankakulula jeyi hakuyikeŋa, hakutonda ni anyanawu alondelumu, kafwampiyenu, chakubadika nyuza yejima neyi chimukumona lelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi alamenu nyivumbu yakunyichima yenu, bayi muchinchika cheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yenu hiNzambi yawa nzambi, hiMwanta wawanyanta, hiNzambi muneni diyi mukwaŋovu, wakutiya woma nankashi, hakomokaŋa muntuku, hiyamufwetaŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi wasompelaŋa ninshona, nintuluwa, diyi wakeŋa aŋa mwenyi, hakumwinka niyakudya niyakuvwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichidinu mwakakeŋaŋa mwenyi, muloŋa ninenu mwadiŋi enyi mwituŋa daEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatiyaŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi woma; diyi wakakalakelaŋa; diyi wakalamata mbe, diyi wakasanyikaŋa ijina dindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyiwashimekapeyi, diyi Nzambi yeyi, wakukopeleli yumoyu yamaneni, yikweti niwoma nankashi, yiwamweni namesu eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ankakulula jeyi akunkumukili muEjipitu nawantu makumi atanu nayedi hohu; hakwinza katataka Yehova Nzambi yeyi nayivulishi dehi neyi chavula tutumbwa twamwiwulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
